HST Office: the print scaling drop-down (.uno:PrintScaleMenu) on the HST Sheets ribbon.

- Page Layout tab, Page Setup group: a large "Scaling" button (bxLayoutPrintScaleMenu / btnLayoutPrintScaleMenu)
  after Breaks; its list is No Scaling, Fit Sheet on One Page, Fit All Columns on One Page, Fit All Rows on One Page
  and Custom Scaling Options (hst-sheets-print-scaling.patch).
- Print preview tab, Page group: the same drop-down, small (bxPrintPrintScaleMenu / btnPrintPrintScaleMenu).
Kept apart from the commands so that the ribbon rework can place the button in its own layout and drop this patch.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_sheets_print_scaling_patch.py.
